(1.1 Introduction) Tj
0 -14 Td
(This technical maintenance manual provides operating limits, inspection procedures, and) Tj
0 -14 Td
(corrective repair workflows for Model M-4500 Three-Phase Industrial Induction Motors.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(1.2 Vibration Thresholds Table) Tj
0 -14 Td
(ISO 10816-3 Industrial Vibration Severity Standard:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Zone A \(Normal\): RMS vibration velocity below 2.3 mm/s \(0.09 in/s\). Smooth operation.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Zone B \(Acceptable\): RMS velocity between 2.3 mm/s and 4.5 mm/s. Continuous operation allowed.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Zone C \(Warning\): RMS velocity between 4.5 mm/s and 7.1 mm/s. Immediate maintenance required.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Zone D \(Critical Danger\): RMS velocity exceeding 7.1 mm/s. Immediate emergency shutdown.) Tj
0 -14 Td
ET
endstream
