(SECTION 3: ROTOR UNBALANCE & SHAFT MISALIGNMENT) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -25 Td
(3.1 Rotor Dynamic Unbalance) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Rotor unbalance generates a dominant 1X running speed radial vibration frequency component.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(When radial vibration at 1X rotational speed exceeds 5.0 mm/s RMS, perform dynamic two-plane balancing.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(3.2 Angular and Parallel Misalignment) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Shaft misalignment typically exhibits strong 2X and 3X shaft speed harmonic vibration peaks) Tj
0 -14 Td
(accompanied by high axial vibration amplitudes. Check flexible coupling elastomeric inserts) Tj
0 -14 Td
(and verify laser alignment tolerances within 0.05 mm offset and 0.04 mm/100mm angularity.) Tj
0 -14 Td
ET
endstream
